  $q$, t, '{"avi": "💬", "cat": "family", "ctx": "엄마가 저녁으로 김치찌개를 끓여주셨는데 너무 짜서 어떻게 말해야 할지 고민하는 상황", "lvl": "i", "msgs": [{"s": "l", "en": "Mom... this kimchi stew is really delicious, but can I drink some water?", "txt": "엄마... 이 김치찌개 정말 맛있는데 물 좀 마셔도 돼요?", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Huh? Why water all of a sudden? Is something wrong?", "txt": "어? 왜 갑자기 물을? 뭔가 이상해?", "who": "엄마"}, {"s": "l", "en": "No, it''s not that... but did you perhaps put more salt than usual?", "txt": "아니에요~ 그런데... 혹시 소금을 평소보다 많이 넣으셨나요?", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Oh right! The kimchi was bland so I added more salt... is it too salty?", "txt": "아 맞다! 김치가 싱거워서 소금을 더 넣었는데... 너무 짠가?", "who": "엄마"}, {"s": "l", "en": "Well... to be honest, it is a bit salty. But it still tastes really good!", "txt": "음... 솔직히 말하면 조금 짜긴 해요. 그래도 맛은 정말 좋아요!", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Oh my, sorry! Would it get better if I add some water and boil it?", "txt": "아이고, 미안해! 물 좀 넣고 끓이면 나아질까?", "who": "엄마"}, {"s": "l", "en": "Yes, that would be good. Next time, try adding salt little by little.", "txt": "네, 그러면 좋을 것 같아요. 다음에는 소금 조금씩 넣어보세요.", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Got it. I was trying to make it tasty but ended up making a mistake instead. Thanks, daughter~", "txt": "알겠어. 맛있게 해주려고 했는데 오히려 실수했네. 고마워, 딸~", "who": "엄마"}], "name": "지민과 엄마", "topic": "엄마가 만든 음식이 너무 짜다고 말하기", "vocab": [{"en": "to be salty", "ko": "짜다", "rom": "jjada"}, {"en": "to be bland/not salty enough", "ko": "싱겁다", "rom": "singgeopda"}, {"en": "honestly/frankly", "ko": "솔직히", "rom": "soljikhi"}, {"en": "usual times (평소보다 = than usual)", "ko": "평소", "rom": "pyeongsoboda"}, {"en": "little by little/gradually", "ko": "조금씩", "rom": "jogeumsik"}], "grammar": [{"ex": "물 좀 마셔도 돼요? - Can I drink some water?", "point": "-아/어도 되다"}, {"ex": "물 좀 넣고 끓이면 나아질까? - Would it get better if I add water and boil it?", "point": "-(으)면"}, {"ex": "맛있게 해주려고 했는데 - I was trying to make it tasty, but...", "point": "-(으)려고 하다"}], "mission": ["Ask politely if you can drink water because the food is salty", "Honestly tell someone that the food is a bit too salty while still being considerate", "Give advice about adding seasoning gradually next time"], "catLabel": "Family"}', '{"avi": "💬", "cat": "family", "ctx": "엄마가 저녁으로 김치찌개를 끓여주셨는데 너무 짜서 어떻게 말해야 할지 고민하는 상황", "lvl": "i", "msgs": [{"s": "l", "en": "Mom... this kimchi stew is really delicious, but can I drink some water?", "txt": "엄마... 이 김치찌개 정말 맛있는데 물 좀 마셔도 돼요?", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Huh? Why water all of a sudden? Is something wrong?", "txt": "어? 왜 갑자기 물을? 뭔가 이상해?", "who": "엄마"}, {"s": "l", "en": "No, it''s not that... but did you perhaps put more salt than usual?", "txt": "아니에요~ 그런데... 혹시 소금을 평소보다 많이 넣으셨나요?", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Oh right! The kimchi was bland so I added more salt... is it too salty?", "txt": "아 맞다! 김치가 싱거워서 소금을 더 넣었는데... 너무 짠가?", "who": "엄마"}, {"s": "l", "en": "Well... to be honest, it is a bit salty. But it still tastes really good!", "txt": "음... 솔직히 말하면 조금 짜긴 해요. 그래도 맛은 정말 좋아요!", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Oh my, sorry! Would it get better if I add some water and boil it?", "txt": "아이고, 미안해! 물 좀 넣고 끓이면 나아질까?", "who": "엄마"}, {"s": "l", "en": "Yes, that would be good. Next time, try adding salt little by little.", "txt": "네, 그러면 좋을 것 같아요. 다음에는 소금 조금씩 넣어보세요.", "who": "지민"}, {"s": "r", "en": "Got it. I was trying to make it tasty but ended up making a mistake instead. Thanks, daughter~", "txt": "알겠어. 맛있게 해주려고 했는데 오히려 실수했네. 고마워, 딸~", "who": "엄마"}], "name": "지민과 엄마", "topic": "엄마가 만든 음식이 너무 짜다고 말하기", "vocab": [{"en": "to be salty", "ko": "짜다", "rom": "jjada"}, {"en": "to be bland/not salty enough", "ko": "싱겁다", "rom": "singgeopda"}, {"en": "honestly/frankly", "ko": "솔직히", "rom": "soljikhi"}, {"en": "more than usual", "ko": "평소보다", "rom": "pyeongsoboda"}, {"en": "little by little/gradually", "ko": "조금씩", "rom": "jogeumsik"}], "grammar": [{"ex": "물 좀 마셔도 돼요? - Can I drink some water?", "point": "-아/어도 되다"}, {"ex": "물 좀 넣고 끓이면 나아질까? - Would it get better if I add water and boil it?", "point": "-(으)면"}, {"ex": "맛있게 해주려고 했는데 - I was trying to make it tasty, but...", "point": "-(으)려고 하다"}], "mission": ["Ask politely if you can drink water because the food is salty", "Honestly tell someone that the food is a bit too salty while still being considerate", "Give advice about adding seasoning gradually next time"], "catLabel": "Family"}');
